Jer 5:1 , The judgments of God upon the Jews, for their perverseness;
Jer 5:7 , for their adultery;
Jer 5:10 , for their impiety;
Jer 5:15 , for their worship of idols;
Jer 5:19 , for their contempt of God;
Jer 5:25 , and for their great corruption in the civil state;
Jer 5:30 , and ecclesiastical.
